<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80549" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεμπτ-αῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>on the fifth day</i>, mostly agreeing with the Subject,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἱκόμεσθα</span>
			<i>on the fifth day</i> we came, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.257
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				4.36
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π.γεγενημένος</span> born
				<i>five days before</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				6.53
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεμπταῖα λογίζομαι . . γενέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					19.59
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκεῖσθαι π</span>. to have been
				<i>five days</i> laid out as dead, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				474
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[νεκροὶ] ἤδη ἦσαν π</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				6.4.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκρινεν [ὁ πυρετὸς]
			πεμπταίοισι</span> came to a crisis <i>with those who had had
				it five days</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀπὸ τῆς νίκης, ἐκ
			γενετῆς</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Fab.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Halc.</u>
				5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>every fifth day</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πυρετοί</span>
			<i>quintan</i> fevers, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.24
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
			</span></i> Aphr.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				2.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτισμοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					729.24
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>.</div>
